# KataRank Environment Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real paths or credentials.
#
# All variables are optional unless marked REQUIRED.
# The server reads .env automatically if python-dotenv is installed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── KataGo binary ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Auto-detected in this order:
#   1. --katago-bin CLI arg
#   2. KATAGO_BIN env var  (this file)
#   3. src/katarank/bin/katago[.exe]  (bundled)
#   4. Known install dirs: ~/katago-fork/release/, ~/katago/, etc.
#   5. PATH
#
# Download from: https://github.com/ahillzhao-msn/KataGo/releases
# KATAGO_BIN=C:\katago-fork\release\katago.exe

# ── KataGo model weights (REQUIRED for inference) ────────────────────────────
# Standard b18 network from: https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo/releases
# KATAGO_MODEL=C:\models\kata1-b18c384nbt.bin.gz

# ── HumanSL model weights ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for training data generation; optional for inference.
# Custom fork release artifact.
# HUMAN_MODEL=C:\models\human_model.bin.gz

# ── KataRank rank model checkpoint ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Enables rank prediction on top of KataGo features.
# Produced by: uv run katarank-train
# KATARANK_CHECKPOINT=C:\models\katarank\best.pt

# ── Analysis daemon config ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Auto-generated at ~/.katarank/analysis.cfg based on GPU VRAM if omitted.
# Delete the generated file to regenerate after a GPU upgrade.
# KATAGO_CONFIG=C:\path\to\analysis.cfg

# ── API server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bind address for the katarank-server REST API.
# Use 0.0.0.0 when running inside Docker or to allow remote access.
# KATARANK_HOST=127.0.0.1
# KATARANK_PORT=8765

# ── SGF root (security sandbox) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# When set, file-based API endpoints (/rank/file, /review/file, etc.) reject
# paths outside this directory. Recommended in production.
# KATARANK_SGF_ROOT=C:\data\sgf

# ── GPU selection ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Restrict PyTorch and KataGo to specific GPUs. Useful on multi-GPU machines.
# CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0

# ── Extra KataGo flags ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Appended to every katago invocation (batch_analysis and analysis daemon).
# KATAGO_GLOBAL_ARGS=

# ── gopredict integration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# URL used by the gopredict frontend to reach the katarank API.
# Must match --host / --port above. Used in gopredict's .env file.
# KATARANK_HOST_URL=http://localhost:8765
